  <ThingDef ParentName="RWCogBaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>Gun_GOW_Longshot</defName>
    <label>Longshot Sniper Rifle</label>
    <description>The "Longshot" is a high-caliber, single-shot, bolt-action sniper rifle, created by the COG during the Pendulum Wars. Highly accurate and extremely deadly, the Longshot specialized in crippling or outright killing threats before they can reach the user.</description>
